# 🚨 Online Payment Fraud Detection Using Machine Learning
---
- 🚀 Internship Project by J.Vyshnavi Reddy,M.Kalam,T.Mahimanvitha,Shaik Ayaz Basha.
- 🎓 Santhiram Engineering College

- 🧠 Platform: SmartInternz with IBM
- 📅 Duration: December-April 2026

---

🧠 Features
- ✅ Real-time fraud prediction  
- ✅ Data preprocessing and feature engineering  
- ✅ Machine learning model training  
- ✅ Probability-based fraud risk scoring  
- ✅ Interactive Streamlit web interface  
- ✅ Clean and modular project structure

---

💡 Technologies Used
- **Python** — Core programming language  
- **Pandas** — Data manipulation and preprocessing  
- **NumPy** — Numerical computations  
- **Scikit-learn** — Machine learning model building  
- **Joblib** — Model serialization and loading  
- **Streamlit** — Interactive web application  
- **Visual Studio Code** — Development environment  
- **Git & GitHub** — Version control and project hosting

---
📊 How It Works
- Loads and cleans transaction dataset
- Performs feature engineering
- Trains machine learning model
- Accepts user transaction input
- Predicts whether transaction is fraud or legitimate

---

🧠 Machine Learning Pipeline
- Data Cleaning
- Feature Selection
- Train-Test Split
- Model Training
- Model Saving using Joblib
- Real-time Prediction via Streamlit

---
## 🖥️ How to Run Locally

---

#Install dependencies
- pip install -r requirements.txt

#Run the app
 - streamlit run app.py
